01:31:09.820 --> 01:31:11.620
And we'll decide...

01:31:12.440 --> 01:31:13.080
Who...

01:31:13.080 --> 01:31:17.680
If you are to be on this earth again.

01:31:18.560 --> 01:31:20.980
But first, my little brother must go.

01:31:23.490 --> 01:31:24.430
Did he turn...

01:31:39.660 --> 01:31:40.720
I'm changing masks.

01:31:40.980 --> 01:31:50.240
To control your mind.

01:31:50.240 --> 01:31:59.600
I was going to keep...

01:31:59.600 --> 01:32:13.680
Give me back my weapon.

01:32:13.840 --> 01:32:16.290
Take this mask off.

01:32:16.370 --> 01:32:16.590
Quick.

01:32:27.700 --> 01:32:28.140
Makuta.

01:32:29.520 --> 01:32:30.960
Your eyes look different.

01:32:31.120 --> 01:32:31.820
They're reddish.

01:32:33.180 --> 01:32:33.620
Yes.

01:32:33.620 --> 01:32:34.760
I got some surgery.

01:32:36.080 --> 01:32:36.520
Now.

01:32:36.620 --> 01:32:38.180
I will defeat you.

01:32:38.480 --> 01:33:45.490
Just keep a tight hold on it.

01:33:45.530 --> 01:33:46.630
So you can't use it.

01:33:51.470 --> 01:33:51.910
Cheater.

01:33:52.190 --> 01:33:52.510
Ha.

01:33:57.640 --> 01:33:58.560
You don't have a go...

01:34:00.060 --> 01:34:00.800
Anymore.

01:34:01.900 --> 01:34:03.260
Yes, I do, Makuta.

01:34:03.760 --> 01:34:04.460
I have two.

01:34:08.160 --> 01:34:08.600
Yes.

01:34:08.880 --> 01:34:23.530
What is he doing?

01:34:23.950 --> 01:34:31.350
It's the Kanoe Kaukau.

01:34:31.670 --> 01:34:38.970
Where's he going?

01:34:39.010 --> 01:34:39.190
Go.

01:34:39.470 --> 01:34:41.430
Got to...

01:34:41.430 --> 01:34:53.820
Now what do we do?

01:34:54.180 --> 01:34:58.740
I'm just going to have to be pummeled by me.

01:34:59.040 --> 01:35:04.980
Got to change him.

01:35:05.140 --> 01:35:08.040
I don't have any other masks.

01:35:08.300 --> 01:35:09.940
Except my Kanoe Miru.

01:35:10.500 --> 01:35:11.460
Kanoe Miru?

01:35:13.120 --> 01:35:13.600
Yeah.

01:35:13.720 --> 01:35:14.500
Like Lei was.

01:35:16.640 --> 01:35:17.780
Except it's red.

01:35:18.140 --> 01:35:40.880
Come on, Makuta.

01:35:41.320 --> 01:36:02.850
My sword is like a whip.

01:36:08.280 --> 01:36:09.080
Got to change him.

01:36:09.360 --> 01:36:21.320
I just created a new mask.

01:36:22.300 --> 01:36:23.140
What is it?

01:36:24.300 --> 01:36:25.940
Why do you need to know, freak?

01:36:26.200 --> 01:36:43.990
You told me that wasn't possible.

01:36:44.350 --> 01:36:44.830
I don't know.

01:36:46.650 --> 01:36:46.850
Ugh.

01:36:47.470 --> 01:36:49.730
There's a scar on my face.

01:36:51.070 --> 01:36:53.210
From last time, Makuta.

01:37:36.020 --> 01:37:39.240
You are the weakest evil that I have ever met.

01:37:40.200 --> 01:37:40.880
Oh?

01:37:41.180 --> 01:46:30.200
That's a Toa Kaita.

01:46:32.820 --> 01:46:39.000
As Tanok mentioned in that one movie, it is true for...

01:46:39.000 --> 01:46:41.080
A Toa Kaita is true.

01:46:47.440 --> 01:46:48.120
Spatula.

01:46:48.320 --> 01:47:01.060
Get him.

01:47:01.300 --> 01:47:07.090
It's pretty good, Makuta, but not good enough.

01:47:07.090 --> 01:47:08.190
Hit him.

01:47:08.750 --> 01:47:10.570
He blocked it.

01:47:11.490 --> 01:47:12.650
Yes, I did.

01:47:23.300 --> 01:47:24.940
Powerful enough to defeat me.

01:47:25.220 --> 01:47:28.080
Except maybe Dr. Shiniora, but he's on our side.

01:47:31.430 --> 01:47:34.170
Pepper, he wants to save his life, because...

01:47:36.470 --> 01:47:37.530
What was that voice?

01:47:38.010 --> 01:47:43.570
It was my illusion.

01:47:44.010 --> 01:47:44.530
Illusions.

01:47:46.430 --> 01:48:12.210
I'm a Toa Kaita.

01:48:25.610 --> 01:48:26.350
We're Hiura.

01:48:26.590 --> 01:48:30.130
Made out of Gally, Lewa, and...

01:48:31.010 --> 01:48:32.090
And, um...

01:48:32.710 --> 01:48:33.270
Kopaka.

01:48:34.750 --> 01:48:35.630
This is a Toa Kaita.

01:48:35.630 --> 01:48:36.350
This is my weapon.

01:48:38.320 --> 01:48:39.200
Ha ha.

01:48:40.360 --> 01:48:42.260
I can block many attacks.

01:48:46.640 --> 01:48:48.200
And I can kick.

01:48:50.510 --> 01:48:51.030
Whoops.

01:48:56.240 --> 01:48:58.380
Now, I must battle for more.

01:48:58.780 --> 01:49:11.300
I didn't know that you would form into a Toa Kaita.

01:49:12.700 --> 01:49:16.120
Toa Kaitas are much more powerful than the Toa.

01:49:16.560 --> 01:49:20.120
They're more powerful than all the Toa that it's made out of combined.

01:49:23.480 --> 01:49:25.500
And even their attacks with it.

01:49:29.910 --> 01:49:30.950
What's that up there?

01:49:34.520 --> 01:49:35.140
Oh, well.

01:49:35.400 --> 01:49:36.880
Let's get back to battle.

01:49:36.880 --> 01:49:39.360
Get him!

01:49:39.580 --> 01:50:21.990
I'm changing mass, Makuta.

01:50:22.430 --> 01:50:35.150
You look different.

01:50:50.540 --> 01:50:54.380
Well, I'm still the same one, except I can see any of your attacks.

01:50:54.800 --> 01:50:56.580
But I can't float in the air.

01:50:56.840 --> 01:52:43.310
I put it into water.

01:52:54.050 --> 01:52:55.370
You, Makuta.

01:52:55.530 --> 01:52:57.750
He, you are we...

01:53:25.610 --> 01:53:26.850
What is he doing?

01:53:33.720 --> 01:53:39.060
Hey, he's taking longer this time.

01:53:52.340 --> 01:54:03.640
Finish you Bakuda!

01:54:54.480 --> 01:54:55.520
My mission...

01:54:56.120 --> 01:54:57.440
No more Bakuda.

01:54:59.900 --> 01:55:00.420
Nooooooo!

01:55:27.440 --> 01:55:29.840
You win, you win, you win! I'll play, I'll play, I'll play!

01:55:30.720 --> 01:55:31.020
Ugh!

01:55:31.300 --> 01:55:32.780
Get away, rodent!

01:55:32.780 --> 01:55:39.760
The super family has defeated me for the third time.

01:55:40.120 --> 01:55:44.550
Get away, you freak!

01:56:21.140 --> 01:56:25.820
Gally, how the heck are we gonna get off this island?

01:56:26.480 --> 01:56:27.240
Well...

01:56:27.240 --> 01:56:35.960
We can't fly off because our canisters are gone with fuel, but Mata Nui's already on the legs.

01:56:36.480 --> 01:56:41.440
But we have these masks, and we can fly away, but, um...

01:56:41.440 --> 01:56:44.700
But we don't...

01:56:44.700 --> 01:56:45.620
Um...

01:56:45.760 --> 01:56:47.700
But we can't leave our canisters here.

01:56:49.500 --> 01:56:53.220
Well, we could dry our canisters behind us.

01:56:54.120 --> 01:56:55.360
No, they're too heavy.

01:56:56.520 --> 01:56:59.680
It will counteract our Miro masks, like the one I have here.

01:57:03.150 --> 01:57:07.250
Oh, but we're gonna have to find another way out. We already mind-controlled the Bohrok.

01:57:09.750 --> 01:57:11.110
Yes, that is true.

01:57:11.390 --> 01:57:14.930
And now they're in the AC's army, so we can use them in the war.

01:57:15.650 --> 01:57:19.190
But they will never die, so that's good, because we have a huge army.

01:57:20.630 --> 01:57:21.310
Yeah...

01:57:22.050 --> 01:57:22.390
Um...

01:57:22.730 --> 01:57:23.450
Well...

01:57:24.330 --> 01:57:27.430
Couldn't we just find a gas station?

01:57:27.970 --> 01:57:30.070
There aren't any gas stations on Mata Nui.

01:57:30.950 --> 01:57:35.150
It's sort of like tribes around here. They don't have, like, electricity and stuff.

01:57:36.050 --> 01:57:36.390
Well...

01:57:37.210 --> 01:57:40.530
Let's see if we can find anything to make oil.

01:57:41.310 --> 01:57:41.990
Hmm...

01:57:41.990 --> 01:57:43.290
That's possible.

01:57:43.830 --> 01:57:48.850
I know of a warp pad that goes along the Trin-Chrom bridge.

01:57:48.850 --> 01:57:54.070
That goes along the Trin-Chrom break.

01:57:54.790 --> 01:57:56.290
That's how we can leave.

01:57:57.670 --> 01:57:58.230
Alright.

01:57:58.230 --> 01:57:59.250
Do you think we can try that?

01:57:59.570 --> 01:58:00.390
I guess.

01:58:01.250 --> 01:58:05.130
Okay, that sells it. We're going along the Trin-Chrom break.

01:58:53.480 --> 01:58:56.620
Join us on our next video, um...

01:58:58.310 --> 01:58:59.370
Uh...

01:58:59.370 --> 01:59:00.670
Escape from Mata Nui.

01:59:03.660 --> 01:59:04.680
Clean up!

01:59:07.580 --> 01:59:08.520
That's a wrap!

01:59:26.600 --> 01:59:28.900
Owlbrain, why not? Didn't I tell you?

01:59:32.020 --> 01:59:37.270
Chain the prisoner!

01:59:37.270 --> 01:59:39.450
The prisoner's between those trees and feed them. Understood?

01:59:40.290 --> 01:59:42.930
Warclaw, you and Badrag are in charge.

01:59:43.270 --> 01:59:44.930
Three Claws, come with me.

01:59:45.110 --> 01:59:45.770
Right, Chief.

01:59:46.030 --> 01:59:47.130
But where are we going?

01:59:47.650 --> 01:59:48.150
Hunting.

01:59:49.790 --> 01:59:51.210
Hunting for slaves.

01:59:52.530 --> 02:00:10.190
Your stripedog all chained up. Silly beast.

02:00:10.450 --> 02:00:12.050
Why'd you let him do that to you?

02:00:12.390 --> 02:00:14.270
We've been captured by Sligar.

02:00:14.430 --> 02:00:15.070
Who are you?

02:00:15.550 --> 02:00:19.010
Skull Droptail's the name. Too clever to let him chain me up.

02:00:19.150 --> 02:00:21.330
Skull Droptail, can you help us?

02:00:21.330 --> 02:00:23.490
Why'd Skull help you, silly beast?

02:00:24.270 --> 02:00:25.770
Not lending him the keys.

02:00:26.590 --> 02:00:29.530
Matty, keys. He's got keys to our locks.

02:00:31.110 --> 02:00:34.190
Skull, if you've got keys, we really need your help.

02:00:37.110 --> 02:00:40.750
Okay, but it'll cost you. Whatcha got, eh? Come on, whatcha got?

02:00:41.210 --> 02:00:43.390
We need something to bargain with. Anything.

02:00:49.760 --> 02:00:54.520
My father gave this to me. I bet he's never seen a blue flower before.

02:00:57.790 --> 02:00:59.730
This is my Season Day gift from Mum.

02:01:00.170 --> 02:01:00.670
It's...

02:01:00.670 --> 02:01:01.970
All I've got.

02:01:05.990 --> 02:01:09.810
Mum's Champion Climber Tail Bracelet. It's my most precious thing.

02:01:12.530 --> 02:01:12.930
Hmm.

02:01:13.030 --> 02:01:19.210
Suppose I better throw this in, too. Dad said it belonged to old Abbot Mortimer long before my time.

02:01:19.550 --> 02:01:30.700
It's all we have.

02:01:31.120 --> 02:01:33.500
Hmm, not much. Not much.

02:01:33.800 --> 02:01:35.540
Hmm. Funny bell, though.

02:01:38.220 --> 02:01:40.240
A white robe would be nice on, Skull.

02:01:40.400 --> 02:01:43.140
Oh, yes. Now try the bracelet on your tail.

02:01:46.130 --> 02:01:48.390
Well, Skull, do we have a deal?

02:01:52.070 --> 02:01:53.150
Uh, deal.

02:01:53.150 --> 02:01:55.310
So, where are the keys?

02:01:55.670 --> 02:01:59.110
Uh, don't carry them. Uh, gotta go for them.

02:02:02.740 --> 02:02:04.880
All right, but be quick about it.

02:02:05.200 --> 02:02:16.520
Did you think I had a key?

02:02:16.780 --> 02:02:18.040
Stupid you, Clever!

02:02:20.310 --> 02:02:21.690
That's pretty gifts for free!

02:02:21.950 --> 02:02:22.190
Ha ha!

02:02:33.560 --> 02:02:34.860
Lying, cheating thief!

02:02:35.680 --> 02:02:36.180
Grrrr!

02:02:36.180 --> 02:02:52.810
Come on, we must be strong. We must try to be strong.

02:03:00.820 --> 02:03:02.620
Ba-ba-ba-ba-ba! Ooh!

02:03:03.100 --> 02:03:03.260
Ha!

02:03:09.880 --> 02:03:11.360
Ooh-hoo-hoo-hoo!

02:03:16.150 --> 02:03:17.010
Oh, yeah!

02:03:17.210 --> 02:03:17.730
Mm-hmm!

02:03:29.520 --> 02:03:30.120
Ha-ha-ha!

